comments.body:
@winni67 

May I ask why you can't use aaps-ci-preparation.html to generate the base64?
The base64 generated by aaps-ci-preparation.html is a single-line string, so it won't have the issue you encountered with certutil.

@MilosKozak 

The user chose not to use the provided tool (aaps-ci-preparation.html) and instead manually generated the base64 using certutil on Windows, which produces multi-line base64 output. This is not an issue that typical users would encounter if they follow the standard workflow. 

Could you please confirm whether this change is needed?
